# scaling-admins-off.vrs: scaling D20 (Session 1), part B. With [Scoreboard] IncludeAdmins = false the admin Chaos is not
# counted, so sc-wave (tools/vrclient/fixtures/sc-wave.json) logs "players 0, gear none, level own, units 4 -> 4" and
# its thugs keep their prefab level 16 (Reference Data/unit_index.tsv).
#
# Needs: what scaling.vrs needs, with [Scoreboard] IncludeAdmins = false (restored after).
# Run: --var AX=-1880 --var AZ=-1640
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
chat .devtp ${AX} ${AZ}
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
mark
chat .nyar event start sc-wave
expect-log event sc-wave started by manual timeout=20
expect-log event sc-wave wave 1/2 timeout=30
expect-seen \[nyar\] scaling sc-wave wave 1: players 0, gear none, level own, units 4 -> 4
wait 8
chat .nyar debug here 40
expect-log CHAR_Bandit_Thug sc-wave left [0-9]+s lvl 16
chat .nyar event info sc-wave
expect-reply scaling now: 0 players, gear none, level own
shot full sc-admins-off
chat .nyar event stop sc-wave
expect-log event sc-wave stopped
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0 timeout=40
console TPHome
wait 3
